# take(function handler(request) { request.end(); request.body().close(); }); known()
# The handler is handed to a function nobody knows, so its parameter is a value nobody knows. Both calls on it are listed under that one root:
# the member of a receiver nobody knows is followed to the receiver, and the result of such a call to its callee. The call of `take` itself comes from the global object.
